#: title/pc5_ui.c:6956
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: VKD3D-Proton turns the game's Direct3D 12 into Vulkan. The "
"fastest, and what most games want."
msgstr ""
"PC5s valg: VKD3D-Proton gjør om spillets Direct3D 12 til Vulkan. Raskest, "
"og det de fleste spill vil ha."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6957
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: Wine's own Direct3D draws the game's DirectDraw with OpenGL."
msgstr ""
"PC5s valg: Wines egen Direct3D tegner spillets DirectDraw med OpenGL."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6958
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: DXVK turns the game's Direct3D into Vulkan. The fastest, and "
"what most games want."
msgstr ""
"PC5s valg: DXVK gjør om spillets Direct3D til Vulkan. Raskest, og det de "
"fleste spill vil ha."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6960
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D 12 (VKD3D). Slower than Auto; try it if the game won't "
"start or draws wrong."
msgstr ""
"Wines egen Direct3D 12 (VKD3D). Tregere enn Auto; prøv det hvis spillet "
"ikke starter eller tegner feil."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6962
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D, drawing with Vulkan. Try it if the game draws wrong "
"with Auto; often faster than WineD3D."
msgstr ""
"Wines egen Direct3D, som tegner med Vulkan. Prøv det hvis spillet tegner "
"feil med Auto; ofte raskere enn WineD3D."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6963
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D, drawing with OpenGL. The slowest; try it if the game "
"won't start with the others."
msgstr ""
"Wines egen Direct3D, som tegner med OpenGL. Tregest; prøv det hvis spillet "
"ikke starter med de andre."

