#: title/pc5_web_page.html:59
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Choose a game's folder: it goes to PC5's INSTALL folder, then PC5 asks to "
"install it."
msgstr ""
"Velg et spills mappe: den havner i PC5s INSTALL-mappe, og deretter spør "
"PC5 om det skal installeres."

