#: title/pc5_web_page.html:278
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Wine writes its .reg files while a game plays: change them only when no "
"game is running."
msgstr ""
"Wine skriver .reg-filene sine mens et spill kjører: endre dem bare når "
"ingen spill kjører."

